====== TP-Link Archer C50 ======
{{section>meta:infobox:864_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

<WRAP alert>The C50v4 is leaking LAN traffic through WAN port during boot, due to lack of port isolation.</WRAP>

Dual band router with 5 fast (100mbps) ethernet ports. Advertised as AC1200 for its 867Mbps (2x2) 5GHz band and 300 Mbps (2x2) 2.4GHz band.  The v1 and v5 have two non-detachable antennas.  The v3 and v4 have four non-detachable antennas.




